[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1049","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1013","title":"FreeBSD setlocale 函数本地任意文件读取漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 5.0 及更早版本中的 setlocale 函数存在任意文件读取漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置 LANG 环境变量为特制路径，触发 setlocale 函数读取系统上的任意文件内容。该漏洞源于 setlocale 在处理环境变量时未对路径参数进行充分校验，导致攻击者能够读取 /etc/master.passwd 等敏感文件，进而可能获取系统凭据或敏感信息。攻击条件要求攻击者拥有本地访问权限，无需额外认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1013"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 系统至 4.1-STABLE 或 3.5-STABLE（2000-09-07 之后版本），或手动修补 libc 源码：下载 FreeBSD-SA-00:53 补丁，以 root 执行 `cd /usr/src/lib/libc && patch < 补丁文件 && make all && make install` 重新编译 libc。修补后运行 `sh scan_locale.sh ./test_locale.sh /` 扫描所有 setuid/setgid 二进制文件，对检测出的静态链接程序移除其 setuid/setgid 权限（`chmod u-s <文件>`）或直接删除，动态链接程序在重编 libc 后自动修复。临时缓解措施：限制可登录系统的用户范围，移除可疑 setuid 二进制文件的 `o+x` 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1013.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1013","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1013.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1013.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f15ca12380fc765fd5195387509666c3b113208/2000/CVE-2000-1013.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1013.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1013.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1013.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1013.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1013.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1048","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1012","title":"FreeBSD catopen 函数本地任意文件读取漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 5.0 及更早版本中的 catopen 函数存在任意文件读取漏洞，由于该函数在处理 LANG 环境变量时未对路径进行充分校验，导致本地攻击者可通过设置恶意的 LANG 环境变量，诱使 catopen 函数读取系统上任意文件。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 5.0 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需额外认证即可利用，可导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1012"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"` tags. Let me provide the correct remediation text based on the FreeBSD-SA-00:53 advisory I fetched.<value>升级 FreeBSD 系统至 4.1-STABLE（2000-08-22 之后）或 3.5-STABLE（2000-09-07 之后）版本，或参照 FreeBSD-SA-00:53 补丁修改 libc 源码后重新编译（cd /usr/src/lib/libc && patch < 补丁文件 && make all && make install）。然后下载运行 scan_locale.sh 扫描所有 setuid/setgid 二进制文件，对使用了 catopen() 的静态链接程序重新编译或移除 setuid 权限，动态链接程序在重编译 libc 后自动修复。临时缓解措施：移除或限制可疑 setuid/setgid 二进制文件的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1012.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1012","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1012.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1012.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c79f038b13e1b688fc233f22ffcfe21236e6044/2000/CVE-2000-1012.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1012.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1012.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1012.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1012.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1012.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1047","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1011","title":"FreeBSD catopen() 函数缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 的 catopen() 函数中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于未对环境变量长度进行有效边界检查，本地攻击者可通过设置超长环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 5.0 及更早版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无需任何认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性的完全丧失。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1011"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 系统至 5.0-RELEASE 之后的补丁版本，或应用 FreeBSD 安全公告 SA-00:53 中提供的 catopen() 补丁。具体操作为：以 root 身份执行 `/usr/sbin/freebsd-update fetch && /usr/sbin/freebsd-update install` 更新系统；若无法升级，可临时限制本地用户设置过长环境变量，或通过 `chmod 755 /usr/lib/libc.so.*` 降低 libc 文件权限作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6070","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5638","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1011.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1011","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1011.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1011.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c79f038b13e1b688fc233f22ffcfe21236e6044/2000/CVE-2000-1011.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1011.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1011.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1011.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1011.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1011.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1046","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1007","title":"I-gear 日志记录 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags as requested.<value>I-gear 3.5.7 及更早版本在处理日志条目时存在输入验证缺陷，当 URL 长度超过 255 个字符时，程序无法正确处理并会引发日志报告错误。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响的 I-gear 系统发送包含超长 URL 的请求，触发日志处理模块异常，导致日志记录不完整或完全失效，影响系统的安全审计与监控能力。该漏洞利用门槛较低，仅需网络可达即可实施，攻击者无需账号权限，且攻击行为可能不留明显痕迹。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1007"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"建议将 I-gear 升级至厂商发布的最新安全版本，并关注 NVD 公告（https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-1007）及 IBM X-Force 漏洞数据库（https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5791）获取补丁信息。如 I-gear 已停止维护且无可用补丁，建议迁移至仍在积极维护的替代日志分析工具（如 AWStats、GoAccess 等），或在 Web 服务器前端通过 URL 长度限制（如 Apache 的 LimitRequestFieldSize 指令、Nginx 的 large_client_header_buffers 配置）将 URL 截断至 255 字符以内，以阻止超长 URL 进入日志，同时定期审查日志格式配置确保日志解析器能正确处理长 URL 条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q4/0048.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5791","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1007.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1007.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1007","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1007.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1007.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1007.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2000/CVE-2000-1007.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1007.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1007.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1007.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1046.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1046.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1045","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1006","title":"Microsoft Exchange Server 5.5 MIME Header 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Exchange Server 5.5 在处理带有空白字符集（charset=\"\"）的 MIME 邮件头时存在解析缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的包含畸形 MIME 头的邮件，触发服务进程崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Exchange 5.5 版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需通过网络发送恶意邮件即可利用，无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1006"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"Exchange Server 5.0 用户应立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-082 提供的补丁（累积更新包，同时修复 MS01-041 和 MS03-046）；Exchange Server 5.5 用户应升级至 Service Pack 4 或安装对应安全补丁。安装后重启 Exchange 服务并清除队列中畸形邮件即可恢复正常运行。Exchange 2000 不受此漏洞影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1869","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-082","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5448","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1006.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1006.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1006","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1006.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1006.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2000/CVE-2000-1006.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1006.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1006.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1006.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1006.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1044","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1004","title":"OpenBSD photurisd 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 的 photurisd 守护进程存在格式化字符串漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在配置文件目录名中插入 %n、%s 等格式化字符，当 photurisd 处理该目录名时触发格式化字符串解析，导致攻击者能够以 photurisd 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 系统，利用条件为攻击者拥有本地访问权限，无需额外认证即可利用。成功利用后可实现权限提升或执行恶意代码，危害系统安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1004"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 2.8 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 OpenBSD 2.8 中修复。如无法升级，可禁用 photurisd 服务（在 /etc/rc.conf 中设置 photurisd_flags=NO），并确保不受信任的用户无法控制配置文件目录名称。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97068555106135&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/6123","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5336","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1004.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1004.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1004","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1004.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1004.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d6ca921ab16ef1f62d93ae6c66f1b85dd0b881a9/2000/CVE-2000-1004.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1004.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/12065efa5942c8c399e6c39fc2649ac2e94409b9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1004.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1004.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1004.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1043","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1003","title":"微软 Windows 95/98/98SE NetBIOS 客户端拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/98SE 系统的 NetBIOS 客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过修改文件共享服务的配置，使其返回未知的驱动程序类型，导致 NetBIOS 客户端在处理异常响应时崩溃，造成目标系统服务中断。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98/98SE 等早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，但利用复杂度较高。由于该漏洞仅导致客户端崩溃而非代码执行，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1003"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Windows 95/98/98SE 并迁移至受支持的操作系统（如 Windows 10/11）。若必须保留，请在防火墙层面封锁 TCP/UDP 137、138、139、445 端口，并在网络适配器属性中禁用 \"NetBIOS over TCP/IP\" 以阻断攻击向量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/139511","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1794","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5370","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1003.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1003.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1003","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1003.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1003.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2000/CVE-2000-1003.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1003.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/97081243d94d5f2106422f70cb011c2bb1229abf/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1003.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1003.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1003.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1042","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1001","title":"Element InstantShop 商品价格篡改漏洞","description":"Element InstantShop 的 add_2_basket.asp 页面存在输入验证缺失漏洞，远程攻击者可通过修改表单中 \"price\" 隐藏字段的值来任意更改商品价格，实现低价或零元购。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响购物车结算流程的完整性，可能导致商家经济损失。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1001"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"Element InstantShop 已停止维护，无官方补丁。修复措施：(1) 修改 add_2_basket.asp 服务端代码，从数据库读取商品真实价格覆盖客户端提交的 price 参数，禁止信任隐藏表单字段；(2) 部署 WAF 规则，拦截 POST 请求中 price 参数值异常（如负数、零或与数据库价格不符）的请求；(3) 建议迁移至仍在安全维护的电商平台（如 Magento、WooCommerce），避免继续使用已停运的 InstantShop。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97240616129614&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/6487","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5402","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1001.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1001","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1001.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1001.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1001.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2000/CVE-2000-1001.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1001.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1001.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1001.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1042.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1042.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1041","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1000","title":"AOL Instant Messenger 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger (AIM) 4.1.2010 存在格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户传输包含格式化字符（如 %s、%n 等）的特殊构造文件名，触发该漏洞，导致 AIM 客户端拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户接收恶意文件即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1000"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 AOL Instant Messenger 至 4.8 及以上版本（AOL 已发布修复该格式字符串漏洞的安全更新）。由于 AIM 已于 2017 年 12 月 15 日正式停止服务，建议彻底卸载 AIM 并改用其他受支持的即时通讯软件（如 Signal、Telegram）。如因业务需要必须继续使用，应在网络层面阻止 AIM 协议流量（TCP 端口 5190），并禁止接收来自不可信来源的文件传输请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/137374","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1747","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5314","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1000.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1000.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1000","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1000.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1000.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2000/CVE-2000-1000.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1000.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1000.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0921","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0921.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1045","title":"红帽 nss_ldap 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"nss_ldap 是 Linux/Unix 系统中用于 LDAP 名称服务集成的 NSS 模块。在运行 nscd（名称服务缓存守护进程）的环境下，121 版本之前的 nss_ldap 未能对远程来源的 LDAP 请求进行合理的速率限制与保护。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量 LDAP 请求，导致 nscd 缓存守护进程消耗过多系统资源，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 nss_ldap 与 nscd 配合进行 LDAP 身份验证及名称解析的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击者无需事先获得系统访问权限即可实施攻击。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1045"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02Z","remediation":"升级 nss_ldap 至 121 或更高版本（如 nss_ldap-121.tar.gz 及后续版本）。若暂时无法升级，可停止 nscd 服务（systemctl stop nscd 或 service nscd stop）或在 /etc/nscd.conf 中禁用 LDAP 缓存（enable-cache ldap no），并重启 nscd 生效。此外可在防火墙层面限制 LDAP 端口（389/636）仅允许受信任 IP 访问，减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-066-1.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-024.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1863","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5449","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1045","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3979a7633898f20f850131e08d621fa27d545855/2000/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1045.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1045.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0921.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0919","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0919.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1040","title":"SuSE ypbind 3.3 调试模式格式化字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.2/6.3/6.4/7.0 所捆绑的 ypbind 3.3 在进入调试模式（debug mode）时，其日志记录函数存在格式化字符串漏洞。攻击者可通过精心构造的日志输入……具体而言，该漏洞会导致程序在日志输出过程中错误地处理格式化字符串选项，进而泄漏文件描述符，并可能引发内存访问错误，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞可利用网络或本地触发，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。由于 ypbind 是用于 NIS 客户端身份验证的关键服务，服务被终止后将导致依赖身份认证的远程用户或本地进程无法正常访问认证资源，影响范围较广。厂商已在后续版本中修复该格式化字符串处理缺陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1040"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01Z","remediation":"该漏洞为 ypbind 3.3 调试模式下日志功能的格式字符串漏洞。修复建议：1) 升级 ypbind 至修复该漏洞的 3.4 或更高版本（3.3 及更早版本存在此缺陷），可从发行版官方软件仓库获取补丁；2) 如无法立即升级，切勿以 debug mode 运行 ypbind（避免对不可信输入直接格式化日志），并在 /etc/inetd.conf 关闭不必要的 ypbind 监听服务；3) 通过防火墙限制对 ypbind 相关端口（如 1011）的访问，仅允许受信任的 NIS 客户端连接，降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0356.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0429.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0262.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-039.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001014","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-064.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-086.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1820","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5394","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1040","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2000/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1040.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1040.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0919.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0776","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0776.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1078","title":"Mirabilis ICQ Web Front Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mirabilis ICQ Web Front Server 的 HTTPd 组件在处理包含问号（?）字符的 URL 请求时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的 URL 请求，触发服务进程崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ICQ Web Front 多个版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需发送单个恶意 HTTP 请求即可利用，但不会造成数据泄露或权限提升。Exploit-DB 已公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1078"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Mirabilis ICQ Web Front 服务，该产品已停止维护多年，无官方补丁可用。建议迁移至其他即时通讯服务端软件（如 Matrix/Synapse、Ejabberd 等），并在防火墙层面封禁 ICQ Web Front 默认端口（80/443）的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/138332","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5332","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20071","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1078","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a5f32c7015b5096d8cfd855ae981350d42219587/2000/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1078.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1078.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0776.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0776.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0776.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0775","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0775.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1075","title":"iPlanet Directory Server 4.12 目录遍历漏洞","description":"iPlanet Certificate Management System 4.2 及 Directory Server 4.12 存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在 Agent、End Entity 或 Administrator 服务中通过注入 \"..\"（点号点号）路径遍历序列，绕过目录访问限制读取服务器上的任意敏感文件。该漏洞影响范围涵盖使用上述版本的组织机构目录服务，攻击者无需凭据即可在低复杂度条件下完成利用，可能导致内部配置文件、证书私钥等机密信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1075"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"立即应用 iPlanet 官方补丁 0122（http://www.iplanet.com/downloads/patches/0122.html）修复目录遍历漏洞，或升级 iPlanet Directory Server 至 4.14 及以上版本。如暂时无法打补丁，可在防火墙层禁用 Agent 服务（8100/tcp）和 End Entity 服务（443/tcp）的对外访问，并限制 Administrator 服务端口仅允许内网管理地址访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0383.html","http://www.iplanet.com/downloads/patches/0122.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4086","http://www.osvdb.org/486","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1839","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5421","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20325","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1075","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b290a4630bf00bc86efda07bc07c03b933274d3f/2000/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8aab22d02785f79271894073fc1a1d558c4aae6b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1075.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2000-1075.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0775.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0773","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0773.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1074","title":"Netscape iPlanet iCal 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Netscape iPlanet iCal 2.1 Patch 2 的 csstart 程序存在本地权限提升漏洞。csstart 程序在安装 libsocket 和 libnsl 共享库时使用相对路径进行加载，且运行 csstart 时会默认从用户当前所在目录启动 cshttpd 服务，导致攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞获取 root 权限。攻击者可在当前目录或父目录中放置特制的共享库（如 libsocket.so.1 伪造库），当 csstart 以 setuid 权限执行时，会优先加载攻击者放置的恶意库，进而通过劫持 socket() 等函数执行任意代码，将权限从普通用户提升至 icsuser 甚至 root。icsuser 账户拥有 iCal 目录和文件的所有权，攻击者可进一步利用该账户在 iCal 库目录中放置 shim 库，在下次 iCal 服务启动或重启时获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 平台上的 Netscape iPlanet iCal 2.1 Patch 2，CVSS 评分满分 10.0，危害等级为严重。攻击条件为攻击者需拥有目标系统本地访问权限并能够执行 csstart 命令，利用方式包括伪造 cshttpd 服务获取 icsuser  shell，以及通过恶意共享库获取 root 权限。@stake 安全公司已于 2000 年发布了完整的利用代码和安全公告。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1074"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"升级到 Netscape iPlanet iCal 2.1 Patch 3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 csstart 程序的相对路径漏洞。如无法升级，应删除 csstart 程序的 setuid 权限（chmod -s /opt/SUNWicsrv/cal/bin/csstart），限制普通用户对 iCal 安装目录的写入权限，并监控 /opt/SUNWicsrv/cal/bin/ 目录下是否存在异常的 libsocket.so.1 或 libnsl.so.1 文件。如业务允许，建议直接停用 iCal 服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a100900-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/7209","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1769","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5757","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20276","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1074","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d5efef4fd74ef7181076173af290c3cdae5dbeb5/2000/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8aab22d02785f79271894073fc1a1d558c4aae6b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1074.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1074.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0773.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0772","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0772.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1072","title":"Netscape iPlanet iCal 本地权限执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-1072是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1072"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"建议升级至 iPlanet Calendar Server 5.0，或联系 iPlanet 支持渠道获取 iCS 2.1 Patch-04 Hotfix 补丁以修复此问题。如暂时无法安装补丁，应立即执行以下临时缓解措施：将 /opt/SUNWicsrv/cal/bin/ 目录及其下所有文件的所有者更改为 root（chown root:root /opt/SUNWicsrv/cal/bin/*），移除 iplncal.sh 脚本的世界可写权限（chmod o-w /opt/SUNWicsrv/cal/bin/iplncal.sh），确保该文件权限为仅 root 可写可执行，防止普通用户替换为木马程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a100900-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/7212","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1768","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5756","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20275","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1072.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1072.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1072","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1072.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcv